{
  "summary": "This experiment tested scgpt as the RNA encoder with transformer aggregation in a multiprofile RNA-only setup. The validation accuracy of 0.5136 is lower than some RNA-only baselines but higher than the singleprofile RNA-only baseline. The effectiveness of scgpt compared to scvi_n200 remains uncertain due to differing aggregation methods and other uncontrolled design choices."
}

